{"3812730": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "SOS (Save Our Ship)", "steam_appid": 3812730, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">**ROADMAP**</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812730/extras/9c3c7f1d128f2401332e028cf1ed9de9.avif?t=1783411172\" width=1560 height=3304 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>✨ WELCOME TO THE WORLD OF SOS! ✨</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this story set across dark oceans, cursed islands, and abandoned ships, your only goal is to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But remember… every island holds a new danger, and every light hides a new secret.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812730/extras/2527e677426d97bdb2bc442d99f7374f.poster.avif?t=1783411172\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812730/extras/2527e677426d97bdb2bc442d99f7374f.webm?t=1783411172\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812730/extras/2527e677426d97bdb2bc442d99f7374f.mp4?t=1783411172\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Some beings… are not pleased with your presence.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They watch you, track your movements, and wait for you to make a mistake.<br>As you walk through the ship’s dark corridors, every step must be taken with caution.<br>The communication systems might be your only lifeline… but the wrong settings could lead your rescuers to be the very ones who wish to destroy you.<br>Change your ship’s communication settings and take a step forward in the fight for survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812730/extras/4cc39b0c4a24bb31883f45b5e2fdd8b6.poster.avif?t=1783411172\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812730/extras/4cc39b0c4a24bb31883f45b5e2fdd8b6.webm?t=1783411172\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812730/extras/4cc39b0c4a24bb31883f45b5e2fdd8b6.mp4?t=1783411172\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Travel from island to island, gathering supplies to survive.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each island hides different dangers; some offer allies, others only death.<br>Food, ammunition, and equipment might be your only chance.<br>But remember… everything you collect might be the treasure someone else is already hunting for.<br>Play with up to 4 players, protect each other… or the islands will consume you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812730/extras/772b0271f641790ee355385603e6a59b.poster.avif?t=1783411172\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812730/extras/772b0271f641790ee355385603e6a59b.webm?t=1783411172\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812730/extras/772b0271f641790ee355385603e6a59b.mp4?t=1783411172\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>When you collapse on the dark sands, your eyes slowly begin to close.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If your teammates don’t find you, this will be your end.<br>Even in limbo, your time is running out.<br>Saving someone might just be the only way to win.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812730/extras/1c24b28dd2f00ed909a7bbae734cf773.poster.avif?t=1783411172\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812730/extras/1c24b28dd2f00ed909a7bbae734cf773.webm?t=1783411172\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812730/extras/1c24b28dd2f00ed909a7bbae734cf773.mp4?t=1783411172\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The dark beach is silent… until the growl of a feral dog fills your ears.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It watches you with hungry eyes, every breath you take revealing your position.<br>Either approach with caution… or run.<br>Because here, the line between hunter and prey is razor thin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812730/extras/5e71f9c61472983ca7becb64018121bf.poster.avif?t=1783411172\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812730/extras/5e71f9c61472983ca7becb64018121bf.webm?t=1783411172\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812730/extras/5e71f9c61472983ca7becb64018121bf.mp4?t=1783411172\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This bridge is the only passage between two islands.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the shadows of your enemies draw closer, the creaking wood beneath your feet reminds you that your time is running out.<br>One wrong step, and the deep darkness will claim you.<br>Run, jump, and cross… or you may never reach the other side again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812730/extras/0200e713356dc257539d9fcdb0c5964b.poster.avif?t=1783411172\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812730/extras/0200e713356dc257539d9fcdb0c5964b.webm?t=1783411172\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812730/extras/0200e713356dc257539d9fcdb0c5964b.mp4?t=1783411172\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">**ROADMAP**</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812730/extras/9c3c7f1d128f2401332e028cf1ed9de9.avif?t=1783411172\" width=1560 height=3304 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>✨ WELCOME TO THE WORLD OF SOS! ✨</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this story set across dark oceans, cursed islands, and abandoned ships, your only goal is to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But remember… every island holds a new danger, and every light hides a new secret.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812730/extras/2527e677426d97bdb2bc442d99f7374f.poster.avif?t=1783411172\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812730/extras/2527e677426d97bdb2bc442d99f7374f.webm?t=1783411172\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><sour